# An Orator of Revelations (CabalBuffer) beside a character of Dawn, which leads the Seven Signs:
# the priest starts preaching as it appears, a minute later and then every minute, a line drawn
# from its four (onCreated, onTimer). Seeing the character, who holds no blessing, it draws 100
# then 10000 and blesses him with the fighter blessing at level 1, with no line: the draw of
# 10000 is not 0 (onSeeCreature). The blessing lands. Expectations are derived from the
# reference source (CabalBuffer.java).
character Seeker 20
cabal dawn gnosis
festival 100 0
random 3 50 1 0
script script.feature.CabalBuffer
npc orator 31094 Folk 100 0 0

advance 59s
